 "q-123885" :question/id #uuid "f19e1b73-1db5-5e9d-8c0b-2a6406bd524f" :question/math-academy-id "q-123885" :question/problem "Which of the following is *not* a simply connected region?" :question/worked-solution "A connected region $D$ is simply connected if every simple closed curve in $D$ can be contracted to a point.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14071672/assets/46305c070e2563b4dacf8b31c88c46b860f003b20ffdff608a5485c09a91bd11.png)\n\nA connected *plane* region $D$ is simply connected if every simple closed curve in $D$ encloses only points in $D.$ In other words, the region does not contain any holes. Plane regions containing holes are not simply connected, since some simple closed curves cannot be contracted to a point:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14071672/assets/a0459ddbabbd810e43db084f5dd174437340914b53ed227f6ef7ce2e3a0fc383.png)\n\nAmong the given options, the only one that does not satisfy this definition is the following: \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14071672/assets/4a67c845fe7993fe0c91784c92201db6ff5c15098db04dc588f5ebe0e8cdc1a1.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-123885/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d1af47ea-6253-5d58-9b94-31e52de27106"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123885"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-98690/selection/6578e6ba0baf24b357651e14e1811fc4e1af585d8babc3d67097617d0e105e7a" :answer/id #uuid "ea295ae8-99a5-5a64-b0a9-926b1071a83f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III and IV only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-98690/selection/a93f071c9e37df87ddd39fa5ca5c1b993bc7a9722336877075659d8a831d9910" :answer/id #uuid "7996c213-14f5-5b09-93c9-526c8f1c2ba7" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/